<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Atlantic Richfield cut.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Atlantic Richfield cut.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Schroder Wertheim &amp; Co said it cut its rating of Atlantic Richfield Co to perform in line from outperform.</p>
<p>-- The stock was off 3/8 to 146-1/2.  It touched a new year high of 147-1/2 during intraday trading.</p>
</text>
